<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="10">
    <title>Mise à jour en cours</title>
    {# Deliberately NOT extending base.html.twig, and no external CSS/JS at
       all: this page can render mid-'installing', while
       Task\InstallUpdateHandler::installFiles() is actively copying the
       new file tree over the live one — an external stylesheet or script
       requested at that exact moment could be missing, truncated, or a
       mismatched mix of old/new versions. A plain <meta http-equiv="refresh">
       re-checks status periodically without needing any script at all,
       which also sidesteps the CSP nonce this app requires for inline
       <script> (script-src 'self' 'nonce-…', no 'unsafe-inline'). #}
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #f8f9fa;
            color: #212529;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        .card {
            max-width: 28rem;
        }
        .spinner {
            width: 2.5rem;
            height: 2.5rem;
            margin: 0 auto 1rem;
            border-radius: 50%;
            border: 0.3rem solid #dee2e6;
            border-top-color: #0d6efd;
            animation: spin 0.8s linear infinite;
        }
        @keyframes spin {
            to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
        }
        p {
            color: #6c757d;
            margin: 0.25rem 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="card">
        <div class="spinner" role="status" aria-label="Mise à jour en cours"></div>
        <h1>Mise à jour en cours</h1>
        <p>{{ status_label }}</p>
        <p>{{ elapsed_label }}</p>
        <p>Cette page se rafraîchit automatiquement.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
